  data: {
    LLM: 'Play low cards early when you have the lead; save high combinations to beat opponents. Coordinate with your partner when you know who they are.\n\nTrack which special combinations (triplets, Sasaki, four of a kind, Pig) have been played. Use jata (pair on a single) to steal the lead when the next player would otherwise play a strong combo.\n\nDecide when to run (expose red 10s) to double stakes; opponents may call stop to quadruple. If alone with both red 10s, time your Pig to go out or force passes.',
    Player: 'Play low cards early when you have the lead; save high combinations to beat opponents. Coordinate with your partner when you know who they are.\n\nTrack which special combinations (triplets, Sasaki, four of a kind, Pig) have been played. Use jata (pair on a single) to steal the lead when the next player would otherwise play a strong combo.\n\nDecide when to run (expose red 10s) to double stakes; opponents may call stop to quadruple. If alone with both red 10s, time your Pig to go out or force passes.',
